    "updated_at": "2023-12-21T11:05:04Z",
    "body": "@annevk Ok, well, I have no idea what the fix is, but I'm glad I was able to highlight something real, at least :)\r\n\r\n(@mnot Selfishly, while I have you and if you have time, I'd still love your opinion on [these potential errata in the HTTP Caching rfc](https://github.com/httpwg/http-core/issues/1109), and possibly this [related issue](https://github.com/httpwg/http-core/issues/1110) too. I think the biggest issue there is about the \"ranking preferences\" with `Vary` + `Accept`. /end my hijacking of this issue.)",
